{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5dd2e71dbb6c322d63f28dfebe76c8d51d99ef07c0311c6821b4c77ad8edaeed", "ja": "（奈緒と杏奈の映画の撮影の日……だが、前の予定が\n長引いてしまい、到着が遅くなってしまった……！）", "zh": "（今天是奈绪和杏奈拍电影的日子……可是之前的安排拖得太久，来晚了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "395982ce568eee3b75235060718b11d49e4612aae116ae9bd78809a709ca7cdf", "ja": "奈緒さん、ありがとう……。\nアメ、おいしかったよ……♪", "zh": "奈绪，谢谢你……。\n糖很好吃……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "b41e6f231b31ee14f92095ce3a411d1911e448ff3338088d06ccf645c70eb123", "ja": "よかったわ。このアメちゃん、めっちゃ効くやろ？\n私もようお世話になってんねん。", "zh": "太好了。这颗糖很管用吧？\n我也经常靠它帮忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6f2b94656457c6861a1e9515f3452fd6f833e21c0b33feb982fe1c7386fd5054", "ja": "お疲れさま、ふたりとも。遅くなってごめん！\n撮影、大丈夫だったか？", "zh": "你们两个，辛苦了。抱歉来晚了！  \n拍摄还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "36418d037dc53f2f157659319f7c746883195bd27ef1759f1494eb3845c80e00", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。\nうん、大丈夫……。しっかりできた、よ……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……  \n嗯，没事……顺利完成了哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "822d00e3076a9be1b766106e5c18e758863a871682b617a7ff2337a5dd1cc89f", "ja": "私も杏奈もバッチリオッケーもらいました～！\n今日のシーンはセリフが多くて、大変でしたけど。", "zh": "我和杏奈也顺利得到了通过～！今天的场景台词很多，虽然挺辛苦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8163d6c30c2efce627f595886a75ef076a21017d97fbed8476b85fb8d5b883ae", "ja": "何事もなくてよかったよ。たくさん喋ると思って、\nのど飴と飲み物を買ってきたんだけど……。", "zh": "没出什么事就好。我想着你要说很多话，就买了润喉糖和饮料过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "4d8748688e66fbe3081b23f3776d9fce4cea58fdd5c367ce616bbcd34b33e030", "ja": "あっ……。さっき杏奈に、秘蔵のアメちゃんあげちゃい\nました。せ、せや！　私、飲みもんもらいますね！", "zh": "啊……刚才我把珍藏的糖给杏奈了。对、对了！那我就拿饮料啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1008_p", "source_sha256": "27bd3052fc75e6128f8b4fa961f9782fc555d85c4ba8052580fdde9bc3eb09be", "ja": "ははっ、気を使ってくれてありがとう。\nまあ、のど飴はいくつあってもいいからな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你这么体贴。\n不过，润喉糖多几颗也没关系嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3c21c04246241a7a5a97ed421f87225acd3a0c7ead3048a7446889ef1fca3109", "ja": "今回の現場も、奈緒が気を回してくれて\nすごく助かってるよ。", "zh": "这次的工作现场，多亏奈绪也替我操心，帮了我很大的忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "2e7013d6291745b4db694d76fe2b42f677692d62fa06b6b45272fdb1154be68a", "ja": "うん……。奈緒さん、休憩中も動いてる気がする……。\n杏奈のことも、ずっと気にかけてくれてるし……。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得奈绪前辈休息时也一直在忙……。\n而且一直都很关照杏奈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "b8451bf590779700714fcae393450db2ceb24e4c39ad6b2caf9b496b64fc71d7", "ja": "いやいや、たまたまですよ～！\nオフの日とか、逆なことも多いですし……。", "zh": "不是不是，只是碰巧啦～！\n休息日之类的，反倒经常是另一种情况……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ae1319bbcbfd3cbc364742830bc831c7c200bd30aed33045a84e531183785b7d", "ja": "逆……？　杏奈が奈緒の世話を？", "zh": "反过来……？是杏奈照顾奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "eb3b32325871438069c3e9e76d3121c999aac9cf5807079e95dc033281176517", "ja": "はい！　この前の休み、杏奈と温泉巡りに\n行ったんですけど、まあ、その……色々あって……。", "zh": "是的！上次休息日，我和杏奈去泡温泉了，不过，那个……发生了各种各样的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "3bb7229bcf3f1584d72e73deda07a2d6c7bc93ac5f3248c3f0f968af983c3ebf", "ja": "奈緒さん、ずっと楽しそうだったね……。", "zh": "奈绪一直都很开心呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "ec8f01fd5a679c493b1b8f907c2d231d7b6c638151bf39e1a3bd7290de26017f", "ja": "杏奈、ずっと奈緒さんのこと……見てた、よ。\nおかげで、たくさん……美味しいもの、食べちゃった。", "zh": "杏奈，一直都在看着奈绪……哦。\n多亏了奈绪，吃了好多……好吃的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "28a81618d3722b375738cadb10f81532f064f9046420c061114bf3faf1d309f3", "ja": "ごめんな、杏奈！　杏奈が美味しそうに食べてるとこ\n見たら、色んなもん食べてほしくて……。", "zh": "对不起啊，杏奈！看到你吃得那么香，  \n就想让你多尝尝各种各样的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c169211a10528209a0aa25ce8c0648ba7a496fed2856ab43be42932987dcbf4b", "ja": "そんなことがあったのか……。\n二人とも楽しかったみたいで、何よりだ。", "zh": "原来发生过这样的事啊……\n看到你们两个好像都玩得很开心，那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "8f0d904a4ea66ed967529e746a23521e1478736934c3af4dae7af25a721984b8", "ja": "うん……。奈緒さんと一緒は、楽しいから……。\nえと……めっちゃ、ありがとう……♪", "zh": "嗯……和奈绪姐在一起，很开心……\n那个……超——感谢你的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "6f817c24a7409e93bcd855c83f462c135a7b7dbf0eeedbd3f9fd4b8b842b6a71", "ja": "杏奈……うれしいこと言うてくれるやん！\nそれに、その言い方！　ばっちりやで、杏奈♪", "zh": "杏奈……你这话说得真让人开心！\n还有你那个说法！非常棒哦，杏奈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "ad90976336b1acea8af0d0a8013db895721318dee3a219d6d215b44504b7cb31", "ja": "また一緒に出掛けよな♪\n今度は杏奈の行きたい場所で、一日中遊びまくるで～！", "zh": "下次再一起出去玩吧♪\n这次就去杏奈想去的地方，玩个痛快一整天～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0484_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7739224ab68336ca161225893640cc4e9011c42e5897297789259667766f2dac", "ja": "（奈緒と杏奈のお互いを思いやる気持ちは、映画を見た\n人にも伝わるはずだ。今から完成が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（奈绪和杏奈彼此体谅的心情，一定也能传达给看电影的人。现在就开始期待成片了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
